{"id":"8290656b9fd644b8","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-topos.md","title":"Theorem — The Lawvere–Tierney Sheaf Subcategory is a Topos","display":"Theorem — The Lawvere–Tierney Sheaf Subcategory is a Topos","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-topos","aliases":["14-thm-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-topos"],"display":"Theorem — The Lawvere–Tierney Sheaf Subcategory is a Topos","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]","[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-topos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — The Lawvere–Tierney Sheaf Subcategory is a Topos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"389620cd4ca5e1c6\" href=\"?note=389620cd4ca5e1c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a169ef2f5263224b\" href=\"?note=a169ef2f5263224b\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure\">14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"592d7bea8469dc16\" href=\"?note=592d7bea8469dc16\" title=\"14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier\">14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}\\)</span> (elementary-topos predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}\\)</span> (Lawvere–Tierney topology, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>-sheaf subcategory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"389620cd4ca5e1c6\" href=\"?note=389620cd4ca5e1c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为固定初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\top:1\\to\\Omega)\">\\((\\Omega,\\top:1\\to\\Omega)\\)</span> 为选定分类子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\Omega)\">\\(j\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\Omega)\\)</span>；本条的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}(j)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}(j)\\)</span> 在此同一语境解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}(j)\\bigr)\\to\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsLTTopology}(j)\\bigr)\\to\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：V.2 Theorem 5，印刷页 226–227；DjVu 第 119 图页。V.3 Theorem 1 另证明反射子左正合，印刷页 227–233；DjVu 第 119–122 图页。</p>\n<p>有限极限与指数封闭已在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a169ef2f5263224b\" href=\"?note=a169ef2f5263224b\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure\">14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure</a> 内建，闭真值分类子由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"592d7bea8469dc16\" href=\"?note=592d7bea8469dc16\" title=\"14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier\">14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier</a> 给出，因此满子范畴满足初等拓扑斯定义。证明不需要先假定层子范畴已经是拓扑斯。左正合反射子另由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fb9c7afb199c12e2\" href=\"?note=fb9c7afb199c12e2\" title=\"14-df-separated-reflection-image\">14-df-separated-reflection-image</a> 至 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2529efea1cd2e435\" href=\"?note=2529efea1cd2e435\" title=\"14-thm-lt-sheafification-adjunction\">14-thm-lt-sheafification-adjunction</a> 逐步构造：闭对角取转置、取像得到分离反射，再在层对象中取闭包得到层化。上述是原书证明的内建展开，未作证明助手验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","